. Ellis","x":"And just to clarify that comment is the lower visibility that you're getting from customers, something that's changed very recently for example as a by-product of the threat of a further increase in U.S. import tariffs on China?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/06/camtek-ltd-camt-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"CAMT 2020 Q1","e":"camt","d":"2020-05-11","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Moshe Eisenberg","x":"And as you know, panels is related to the cost reduction of Fan-Out applications and it's a very important trend.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/11/camtek-ltd-camt-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"CAMT 2020 Q1","e":"camt","d":"2020-05-11","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ramy Langer","x":"This is very important for us as this allows us to streamline the manufacturing and installation of the machines in a better way.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/11/camtek-ltd-camt-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"CAMT 2021 Q2","e":"camt","d":"2021-08-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Moshe Eisenberg","x":"There are some price increases, but not significant that impacts our margins.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/05/camtek-camt-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CAMT 2022 Q1","e":"camt","d":"2022-05-12","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Thomas O'Malley","x":"Are you raising prices at all to keep these gross margins where they are?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/05/12/camtek-camt-q1-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CAMT 2022 Q4","e":"camt","d":"2023-02-16","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Moshe Eisenberg","x":"In order to improve the gross margin this year, we plan to focus on cost reduction through engineering and design optimizations and supply chain initiatives.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/02/16/camtek-camt-q4-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CAMT 2023 Q2","e":"camt","d":"2023-07-31","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Rafi Amit","x":"This is fueled by major investment around HI -- AI.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/08/02/camtek-camt-q2-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CAMT 2024 Q4","e":"camt","d":"2025-02-12","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Moshe Eisenberg","x":"This year, we are kind of ramping the production, streamlining the processes, and next year you will see the benefit and the contribution to the gross margin.Vedvati ShrotreThat's helpful.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/02/12/camtek-camt-q4-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CAMT 2025 Q3","e":"camt","d":"2025-11-10","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Rafi Amit","x":"With the accelerated adoption of AI and the recent announcement of a major data center investment by leading industry players, it is clear that the industry is heading toward a significant expansion of manufacturing capacity.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/04/camtek-camt-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"CAMT 2025 Q3","e":"camt","d":"2025-11-10","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Rafi Amit","x":"In summary, the massive investment in data centers and the accelerating adoption of AI-driven applications are expected to translate into increasing demand for advanced semiconductor manufacturing equipment.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/04/camtek-camt-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"CAMT 2025 Q4","e":"camt","d":"2026-02-18","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Michael Mani","x":"Do you feel like that's still the right size of the footprint to address all that demand?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/04/camtek-camt-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"CAMT 2026 Q2","e":"camt","d":"2026-08-10","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Rafi Amit","x":"The AI revolution is driving unprecedented demand for data center, compute capacity and power infrastructure.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/17/camtek-camt-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CAMT 2026 Q2","e":"camt","d":"2026-08-10","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Rafi Amit","x":"With AI adoption still in its early stage, we believe demand for AI compute infrastructure will continue to grow significantly, supporting sustained investment in AI data center and advanced semiconductor manufacturing.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/17/camtek-camt-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CAMT 2026 Q3","e":"camt","d":"2026-11-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Ramy Langer","x":"Let me talk about raising prices.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/04/camtek-camt-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CAMT 2026 Q3","e":"camt","d":"2026-11-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Ramy Langer","x":"Raising some due to the increase in prices, our own prices, but I think on a greater scale, adding the new capabilities, the new developments that we are implementing in our machines, a reason for additional price increase.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/04/camtek-camt-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CAMT 2026 Q3","e":"camt","d":"2026-11-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Moshe Eisenberg","x":"First of all, indeed, we were a bit disappointed by the gross margin level, although we did implement cost reduction initiatives during the quarter, which will benefit us in the future as well.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/04/camtek-camt-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CAMT 2026 Q3","e":"camt","d":"2026-11-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Moshe Eisenberg","x":"Again, as I said before, it is a combination of the cost reduction initiatives that are already in place, the favorable product m